SOLUTION 1  River Water
    units   mmol/L
    pH      6.0
    Cl      10      charge
    temp    25

SOLUTION 2  Seawater
    units   mmol/L
    pH      8.1
    Cl      536     charge
    temp    25

MIX 1
    1   0.7
    2   0.3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file           mix_water6.sel
    -reset          false
    -solution       true
    -pH             true
    -activities     H+

END
